Problem Statement:
Sample Input
3 2
1 5 3
3 1
5 7

Sample Output
1
Program:
n, m = map(int, input().split())
storage = list(map(int, input().split()))
A = set(map(int, input().split()))
B = set(map(int, input().split()))
happiness = 0
for i in storage:
    if i in A:
        happiness += 1
    elif i in B:
        happiness -= 1
print(happiness)
